1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 25=

4
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:41,860
Why didn't you leave just now?

5
00:01:43,100 --> 00:01:44,220
If I'd left,

6
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:47,020
you would've cursed me
with your dying breath

7
00:01:47,700 --> 00:01:48,540
for being cold and heartless.

8
00:01:51,860 --> 00:01:53,500
I never expected you to stay.

9
00:01:55,140 --> 00:01:55,740
I know.

10
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:06,860
Come on. I'll carry you.

11
00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:07,500
No need.

12
00:02:08,300 --> 00:02:09,100
It's just the two of us.

13
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:10,620
If we head deeper into the woods

14
00:02:11,260 --> 00:02:12,260
and Qiu Shuo's men surround us,

15
00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:13,660
we'll be in even greater danger.

16
00:02:17,060 --> 00:02:17,660
You're right.

17
00:02:18,620 --> 00:02:20,140
He might make us disappear
without a trace,

18
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:22,300
then claim we fled to escape punishment

19
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:23,660
and vanished.

20
00:02:29,460 --> 00:02:30,140
Give me the signal flare.

21
00:02:41,100 --> 00:02:41,660
Are you insane?

22
00:02:41,900 --> 00:02:42,380
Don't light it!

23
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:44,980
I made an agreement with Lu Yan,
General of the Left Jinwu Guard.

24
00:02:45,580 --> 00:02:46,660
He promised to help me
defeat the traitors.

25
00:02:47,660 --> 00:02:48,420
If he's willing

26
00:02:48,740 --> 00:02:49,580
to ride to our aid tonight,

27
00:02:49,820 --> 00:02:50,740
we'll have reinforcements.

28
00:02:52,420 --> 00:02:53,180
I just hope

29
00:02:53,780 --> 00:02:55,060
he doesn't turn out like Mu Xianqing.

30
00:02:55,620 --> 00:02:56,740
But if we send up the signal,

31
00:02:57,180 --> 00:02:58,220
the Jinwu Guards won't be the only ones
to see it.

32
00:02:58,660 --> 00:02:59,620
Qiu Shuo will spot it too!

33
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:01,180
Even if we don't,

34
00:03:01,820 --> 00:03:03,060
Qiu Shuo will find us sooner or later.

35
00:03:03,060 --> 00:03:04,980
Even if Lu Yan keeps his promise,

36
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:06,620
he's far beyond the hunting grounds,

37
00:03:07,100 --> 00:03:08,220
while Qiu Shuo is right nearby.

38
00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:10,420
If the Jinwu Guards arrive
after Qiu Shuo,

39
00:03:10,940 --> 00:03:11,940
we're dead anyway.

40
00:03:13,220 --> 00:03:14,500
There's one more possibility.

41
00:03:15,780 --> 00:03:16,660
If the Jinwu Guards

42
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:18,500
get here before Qiu Shuo,

43
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:19,980
we'll be saved.

44
00:03:21,740 --> 00:03:23,380
How is that even possible?

45
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:26,300
Even if the odds are slim

46
00:03:27,220 --> 00:03:28,220
and we're almost certain to die,

47
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,260
so what?

48
00:03:31,060 --> 00:03:32,140
As long as there's a chance,

49
00:03:32,580 --> 00:03:33,540
we have to take it.

50
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:42,380
All right, then.

51
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:44,340
Tonight, I, Yang Si,

52
00:03:44,740 --> 00:03:46,100
risked my life to stand by you.

53
00:03:47,140 --> 00:03:48,460
I've already put my neck on the line.

54
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:51,500
Might as well

55
00:03:52,580 --> 00:03:53,740
take one more gamble with you!

56
00:04:05,340 --> 00:04:06,660
So that's where they are!

57
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:07,500
Move!

58
00:04:10,380 --> 00:04:10,820
General Lu,

59
00:04:11,220 --> 00:04:12,220
whoever sent up that signal

60
00:04:12,340 --> 00:04:13,180
should be a few miles away.

61
00:04:13,420 --> 00:04:14,060
Shall we move out?

62
00:04:29,820 --> 00:04:30,260
Mu Xun.

63
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:34,380
Your heart is pounding.

64
00:04:35,780 --> 00:04:36,660
I can hear it.

65
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:40,140
Really?

66
00:04:44,980 --> 00:04:45,700
Stay alert!

67
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:47,140
You guys, go that way!

68
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:47,740
Yes, sir!

69
00:04:47,940 --> 00:04:48,620
The rest of you, follow me!

70
00:04:48,900 --> 00:04:49,260
Yes, sir!

71
00:04:50,580 --> 00:04:50,900
Come on!

72
00:05:08,820 --> 00:05:10,020
So it ends the same way after all.

73
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:16,220
Making an ally of someone
like Mu Xianqing...

74
00:05:17,380 --> 00:05:19,540
Weren't you afraid he'd turn on you?

75
00:05:24,780 --> 00:05:25,660
I'm sorry, Yang Si.

76
00:05:26,860 --> 00:05:27,940
I'll get you killed this time.

77
00:05:29,900 --> 00:05:31,500
Better to die fighting in righteous fury

78
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:34,140
than live in disgrace
under that treacherous eunuch.

79
00:05:36,020 --> 00:05:36,460
Your Royal Highness,

80
00:05:37,260 --> 00:05:38,340
you asked me ten years ago,

81
00:05:39,180 --> 00:05:41,100
and I said I'd always stand by your side

82
00:05:42,060 --> 00:05:42,940
until my very last breath.

83
00:05:43,740 --> 00:05:44,540
That hasn't changed.

84
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:48,740
Then let's fight them together.

85
00:05:52,740 --> 00:05:53,820
The Crown Prince, Mu Xun,

86
00:05:54,460 --> 00:05:54,980
has plotted

87
00:05:55,460 --> 00:05:56,620
to seize the throne before his time,

88
00:05:56,980 --> 00:05:58,060
murder his father, and rebel!

89
00:05:58,820 --> 00:06:00,900
Yang Si of the Court of Judicial Review
is his lackey,

90
00:06:01,300 --> 00:06:02,180
guilty of high treason!

91
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:03,540
Seize them both!

92
00:06:05,540 --> 00:06:06,620
Kill them on sight!

93
00:06:07,580 --> 00:06:08,020
Yes, sir!

94
00:06:33,380 --> 00:06:34,420
General Meng.

95
00:06:35,540 --> 00:06:36,500
I never thought

96
00:06:37,060 --> 00:06:39,340
you'd get mixed up in this mess too!

97
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:41,180
These are your men?

98
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:43,900
What are you doing, General Meng?

99
00:06:45,220 --> 00:06:46,380
I wonder if Your Royal Highness

100
00:06:47,260 --> 00:06:48,500
has any regrets now.

101
00:06:49,540 --> 00:06:50,740
Why bother with Mu Xianqing?

102
00:06:51,300 --> 00:06:52,340
You should've come to me!

103
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:58,140
Yan Shang? What are you doing here?

104
00:06:58,820 --> 00:07:00,140
Quick! Get out of here!

105
00:07:00,620 --> 00:07:01,620
I'll explain everything later.

106
00:07:01,660 --> 00:07:02,300
But what about here?

107
00:07:03,460 --> 00:07:04,300
Get the Crown Prince to safety!

108
00:07:04,580 --> 00:07:05,340
I'll deal with my friends here!

109
00:07:05,340 --> 00:07:06,420
Come on! Leave it to him!

110
00:07:16,300 --> 00:07:18,100
I saw Mu Xianqing's body just now.

111
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:20,300
Thank you.

112
00:07:21,020 --> 00:07:22,500
I killed him for Lord Yu.

113
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:24,300
It had nothing to do with you.

114
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:25,700
Qiu Shuo,

115
00:07:26,460 --> 00:07:27,660
I've rarely respected anyone in my life.

116
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:29,700
You're a true hero of our time.

117
00:07:30,180 --> 00:07:31,380
Why be that eunuch's lapdog?

118
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:32,020
Shut up!

119
00:07:33,180 --> 00:07:35,340
Lord Yu recognized my worth
and gave me my chance.

120
00:07:36,220 --> 00:07:38,260
He cared for my parents in life
and buried them in death.

121
00:07:39,180 --> 00:07:40,420
For ten years of fighting rebellions,

122
00:07:41,300 --> 00:07:43,460
I've risked my life fighting
by his side.

123
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:46,540
But you...

124
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:49,460
You killed your lord
in the Central Circuit and seized power!

125
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:51,700
I am nothing like you!

126
00:07:52,460 --> 00:07:53,260
I would never

127
00:07:53,780 --> 00:07:55,380
betray my lord!

128
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:44,700
Now Meng's getting involved too.

129
00:08:45,820 --> 00:08:47,420
He can't seriously want
to be your brother-in-law, can he?

130
00:08:48,060 --> 00:08:48,660
Yang Si,

131
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:50,180
give it a rest.

132
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:51,340
Stop talking nonsense.

133
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:52,540
Your Royal Highness, your wound...

134
00:08:55,700 --> 00:08:56,220
I hear something.

135
00:09:00,540 --> 00:09:01,300
Hoofbeats.

136
00:09:12,060 --> 00:09:13,380
(Lu Yan,
General of the Left Jinwu Guard)

137
00:09:13,380 --> 00:09:14,860
I am Lu Yan of the Left Jinwu Guard.

138
00:09:15,060 --> 00:09:15,780
Forgive my late arrival

139
00:09:16,020 --> 00:09:17,300
to rescue you, Your Royal Highness.

140
00:09:20,300 --> 00:09:21,340
Lu Yan, hear my orders.

141
00:09:21,940 --> 00:09:22,980
Join me in a counterattack

142
00:09:23,580 --> 00:09:24,660
and kill the treacherous eunuch!

143
00:09:26,020 --> 00:09:26,340
Yes!

144
00:09:34,380 --> 00:09:35,020
What time is it?

145
00:09:35,780 --> 00:09:36,900
It's already past the hour of Chou.

146
00:09:38,500 --> 00:09:39,220
It's taken far too long.

147
00:09:39,780 --> 00:09:40,580
Qiu Shuo is in grave danger.

148
00:09:41,020 --> 00:09:41,500
Sir,

149
00:09:42,660 --> 00:09:43,740
we must act quickly.

150
00:09:47,100 --> 00:09:47,740
Send word

151
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:48,900
to the Shence Army.

152
00:09:49,140 --> 00:09:50,220
Have them enter the hunting grounds
early as reinforcements.

153
00:09:51,100 --> 00:09:51,420
Yes.

154
00:10:00,420 --> 00:10:00,860
Wenji.

155
00:10:02,980 --> 00:10:04,380
There's likely to be chaos here.

156
00:10:04,900 --> 00:10:06,100
Keep a close eye on His Majesty

157
00:10:06,860 --> 00:10:07,580
and that woman for me.

158
00:10:08,540 --> 00:10:09,500
Don't disappoint me.

159
00:10:11,620 --> 00:10:11,940
Yes.

160
00:10:39,260 --> 00:10:39,660
Yang Si,

161
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:41,260
once we're inside, attack immediately.

162
00:10:41,580 --> 00:10:42,300
End it quickly.

163
00:10:43,020 --> 00:10:44,220
Don't give Yu Cheng'an
a chance to speak,

164
00:10:44,380 --> 00:10:45,300
or he'll pull the same trick again.

165
00:10:45,580 --> 00:10:45,980
Understood!

166
00:10:49,620 --> 00:10:49,940
Don't be afraid.

167
00:10:52,300 --> 00:10:52,780
Wenji,

168
00:10:54,420 --> 00:10:55,540
why did Lord Yu have me captured?

169
00:10:57,180 --> 00:10:58,420
Why is His Majesty here?

170
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:03,260
Am I going to die?

171
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:04,220
Don't ask any questions.

172
00:11:13,860 --> 00:11:14,220
Chunhua!

173
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:15,700
Chunhua!

174
00:11:27,300 --> 00:11:28,300
(Huai)

175
00:11:33,460 --> 00:11:33,940
Yu Cheng'an

176
00:11:34,580 --> 00:11:35,460
has seized control of the government

177
00:11:35,700 --> 00:11:36,460
and committed countless abuses!

178
00:11:37,180 --> 00:11:38,620
Now he even dares to frame
the Crown Prince!

179
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:39,660
His crimes are unforgivable!

180
00:11:40,540 --> 00:11:42,060
Lu Yan of the Left Jinwu Guard,
hear my orders!

181
00:11:43,380 --> 00:11:44,580
Storm the temporary imperial palace
with me

182
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:46,140
and wipe out the traitor!

183
00:11:47,940 --> 00:11:49,100
How dare you, Lu Yan.

184
00:11:49,660 --> 00:11:50,900
You dare storm here?

185
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,900
Are you conspiring with the Crown Prince

186
00:11:53,340 --> 00:11:54,300
to commit treason?

187
00:11:54,700 --> 00:11:55,460
Treason?

188
00:11:57,740 --> 00:11:59,020
General Lu, don't waste your breath
on him.

189
00:11:59,820 --> 00:12:01,620
His Majesty is resting inside.

190
00:12:02,060 --> 00:12:02,980
General Lu,

191
00:12:03,420 --> 00:12:04,300
what do you intend to do?

192
00:12:04,860 --> 00:12:05,420
What?

193
00:12:07,300 --> 00:12:09,140
Isn't His Majesty at Taiji Palace?

194
00:12:11,380 --> 00:12:12,740
Where His Majesty is,

195
00:12:13,180 --> 00:12:13,940
surely the Crown Prince

196
00:12:14,660 --> 00:12:15,860
knows perfectly well.

197
00:12:17,300 --> 00:12:20,020
The Crown Prince and Mr. Yang
both saw him earlier.

198
00:12:20,420 --> 00:12:20,940
His Majesty

199
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:22,940
is right here.

200
00:12:23,540 --> 00:12:25,500
Yet you dare lead troops inside

201
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:26,780
and plot against the Emperor!

202
00:12:27,260 --> 00:12:28,820
Aren't you afraid your entire clan
will be executed?

203
00:12:34,820 --> 00:12:35,340
Your Royal Highness,

204
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:36,940
is that true?

205
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:04,780
Wenji.

206
00:13:05,340 --> 00:13:05,820
Wenji.

207
00:13:06,140 --> 00:13:06,620
Chunhua.

208
00:13:08,020 --> 00:13:08,500
I'm right here.

209
00:13:09,940 --> 00:13:10,500
I'm here with you.

210
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:17,220
Utter nonsense!

211
00:13:21,660 --> 00:13:23,540
Every official knows
His Majesty is unwell.

212
00:13:24,340 --> 00:13:26,140
He hasn't appeared in public
since the birthday banquet.

213
00:13:26,220 --> 00:13:27,700
He's been recovering at Taiji Palace.

214
00:13:28,380 --> 00:13:29,460
Even this winter hunt

215
00:13:29,820 --> 00:13:32,300
was entrusted entirely to Lord Yu
by His Majesty.

216
00:13:32,740 --> 00:13:35,140
His Majesty personally granted Lord Yu
use of the temporary imperial palace.

217
00:13:35,780 --> 00:13:36,540
Everyone knows that.

218
00:13:37,300 --> 00:13:38,340
The only person

219
00:13:38,620 --> 00:13:40,180
staying here is Lord Yu.

220
00:13:41,020 --> 00:13:41,940
How could His Majesty be here?

221
00:13:42,180 --> 00:13:43,380
Lord Yu is indeed here.

222
00:13:44,300 --> 00:13:45,140
But so

223
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:46,500
is His Majesty.

224
00:13:49,540 --> 00:13:50,060
Is that so?

225
00:13:51,580 --> 00:13:53,540
But Sheng'an's over 50 li away.

226
00:13:54,100 --> 00:13:55,700
It's hardly a short walk.

227
00:13:56,500 --> 00:13:58,180
If His Majesty really traveled
to the hunting grounds,

228
00:13:58,900 --> 00:13:59,660
surely someone along the way

229
00:14:00,420 --> 00:14:02,500
would've seen his imperial procession.

230
00:14:02,780 --> 00:14:04,540
His Majesty traveled
with a small escort,

231
00:14:05,420 --> 00:14:06,540
disguised as a commoner.

232
00:14:06,980 --> 00:14:08,100
All the court officials are here.

233
00:14:08,900 --> 00:14:10,660
The Crown Prince and Princess are here.

234
00:14:11,020 --> 00:14:12,740
Even the military governors
of two Circuits are here.

235
00:14:13,300 --> 00:14:15,220
Yet the Emperor alone came in disguise?

236
00:14:15,500 --> 00:14:16,500
General Lu,

237
00:14:17,220 --> 00:14:18,140
does that sound believable to you?

238
00:14:27,900 --> 00:14:28,580
The Crown Prince

239
00:14:29,060 --> 00:14:29,700
and Yang Si

240
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:32,820
stormed the temporary imperial palace
hours ago and threatened His Majesty,

241
00:14:32,820 --> 00:14:34,260
committing an act of high treason.

242
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:37,020
Lord Yu ordered us to defend
the Emperor with our lives.

243
00:14:37,180 --> 00:14:38,540
That's the only reason
their plot failed.

244
00:14:39,260 --> 00:14:40,900
But after they escaped,

245
00:14:40,940 --> 00:14:42,820
they somehow tricked General Lu
into coming here.

246
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:45,700
What kind of position

247
00:14:46,140 --> 00:14:47,140
are they putting General Lu in?

248
00:14:58,260 --> 00:14:58,740
Your Royal Highness,

249
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:00,140
Mr. Yang,

250
00:15:01,700 --> 00:15:02,860
you told me

251
00:15:02,940 --> 00:15:04,580
that the person you saw

252
00:15:04,700 --> 00:15:05,700
inside the temporary imperial palace
wasn't His Majesty.

253
00:15:06,300 --> 00:15:07,100
Is that true?

254
00:15:16,780 --> 00:15:17,260
That's right.

255
00:15:18,340 --> 00:15:18,980
My father

256
00:15:19,940 --> 00:15:21,300
never came to the hunting grounds!

257
00:15:22,220 --> 00:15:23,820
That treacherous Yu Cheng'an
had the nerve

258
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:26,100
to plant a double in
the temporary imperial palace

259
00:15:26,540 --> 00:15:27,620
and frame me for treason!

260
00:15:29,020 --> 00:15:29,540
That man

261
00:15:30,340 --> 00:15:31,620
looks and sounds

262
00:15:31,940 --> 00:15:33,020
just like my father.

263
00:15:34,180 --> 00:15:34,740
But

264
00:15:35,060 --> 00:15:36,980
as his son, I know what I saw.

265
00:15:37,380 --> 00:15:39,580
He is a double!

266
00:15:44,020 --> 00:15:44,980
Your Royal Highness,

267
00:15:45,540 --> 00:15:47,020
there can be only one ruler,

268
00:15:47,820 --> 00:15:49,580
but why are you in such a hurry
to take his place?

269
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:51,540
His Majesty has retired for the night.

270
00:15:52,180 --> 00:15:54,060
Lord Yu and I didn't wish
to disturb him.

271
00:15:54,700 --> 00:15:56,060
But given the circumstances,

272
00:15:56,740 --> 00:15:58,660
we may have no choice
but to request His Majesty's presence

273
00:15:58,980 --> 00:15:59,980
and let General Lu

274
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:01,660
see for himself.

275
00:16:03,460 --> 00:16:03,900
Chunhua,

276
00:16:04,460 --> 00:16:05,140
I don't care about anyone else.

277
00:16:06,020 --> 00:16:06,820
You have to stay alive.

278
00:16:17,020 --> 00:16:17,540
Wenji!

279
00:16:18,180 --> 00:16:18,780
Wenji!

280
00:16:20,260 --> 00:16:20,740
Wenji!

281
00:16:28,340 --> 00:16:28,780
Chunhua,

282
00:16:30,420 --> 00:16:31,060
you must survive.

283
00:16:31,980 --> 00:16:32,900
Your baby must survive too.

284
00:17:04,260 --> 00:17:05,580
I am Princess Danyang!

285
00:17:08,820 --> 00:17:10,220
I have His Majesty's written decree!

286
00:17:34,660 --> 00:17:35,580
Princess Danyang,

287
00:17:36,340 --> 00:17:37,460
how can you prove

288
00:17:37,700 --> 00:17:38,780
the decree is genuine?

289
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:41,460
I met with His Majesty

290
00:17:42,580 --> 00:17:43,500
and brought back his decree.

291
00:17:44,020 --> 00:17:45,740
Every city gate and palace gate
I passed through

292
00:17:46,060 --> 00:17:46,820
has a record of my passage.

293
00:17:47,540 --> 00:17:48,340
How could it be fake?

294
00:17:54,060 --> 00:17:54,420
Your Highness,

295
00:17:55,140 --> 00:17:56,100
aren't we heading straight back
to the hunting grounds?

296
00:17:56,460 --> 00:17:57,260
To my residence first!

297
00:18:13,340 --> 00:18:15,580
(By imperial command: Meng Baiyu
has shown virtue and loyalty.)

298
00:18:15,580 --> 00:18:17,960
(Our eldest daughter, Princess Danyang,
is gentle, virtuous, and well-mannered.)

299
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:20,660
(I hereby decree her marriage
into the Meng family. May they prosper.)

300
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:23,240
(May they enjoy marital harmony.
Let this decree be carried out.)

301
00:18:29,940 --> 00:18:31,140
General of the Left Jinwu Guard,

302
00:18:31,700 --> 00:18:32,140
Lu Yan,

303
00:18:32,860 --> 00:18:33,340
receive the imperial decree!

304
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:34,900
At your command!

305
00:18:37,700 --> 00:18:38,700
"Since Yu became one
of the Three Excellencies,

306
00:18:39,300 --> 00:18:40,140
the wilds hold starved corpses,

307
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:41,780
our nation has suffered
countless calamities,

308
00:18:42,260 --> 00:18:43,140
and countless families have wept,

309
00:18:43,860 --> 00:18:44,700
while one man alone enjoys
power and glory.

310
00:18:45,740 --> 00:18:47,180
I entrusted Huai to the Yu family

311
00:18:47,740 --> 00:18:48,700
and made a terrible mistake.

312
00:18:49,220 --> 00:18:50,220
Now I must set things right.

313
00:18:50,660 --> 00:18:52,980
The Jinwu Guard shall aid
the Crown Prince in slaying this traitor

314
00:18:53,820 --> 00:18:54,860
and saving our people.

315
00:18:55,260 --> 00:18:56,860
Those who charge forward shall receive
a hundred strings of coins.

316
00:18:57,540 --> 00:18:58,180
Whoever takes the traitor's head

317
00:18:58,540 --> 00:18:59,620
shall be granted the title
of Marquis for military merit!"

318
00:19:00,860 --> 00:19:01,780
Princess Danyang,

319
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:03,260
forging an imperial decree

320
00:19:03,820 --> 00:19:05,100
is punishable by death.

321
00:19:06,900 --> 00:19:07,940
Those who follow her

322
00:19:08,980 --> 00:19:10,540
will have their entire clans executed!

323
00:19:13,580 --> 00:19:16,060
The Princess received this decree
at Taiji Palace,

324
00:19:16,380 --> 00:19:18,420
directly from His Majesty himself.

325
00:19:18,900 --> 00:19:21,340
Even if you bring out a double

326
00:19:22,180 --> 00:19:23,300
and manage to fool everyone else,

327
00:19:24,220 --> 00:19:26,700
how could you fool the Crown Prince
and Princess?

328
00:19:28,780 --> 00:19:29,700
An hour ago,

329
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:31,660
my father was at Taiji Palace,

330
00:19:31,940 --> 00:19:33,100
giving me this decree in person.

331
00:19:33,620 --> 00:19:34,820
He's been ill for a long time.

332
00:19:35,100 --> 00:19:36,300
Even as he affixed the imperial seal,

333
00:19:36,660 --> 00:19:37,500
he was coughing and struggling
to breathe.

334
00:19:38,460 --> 00:19:39,420
How could he possibly travel

335
00:19:39,700 --> 00:19:40,980
all the way to this
temporary imperial palace?

336
00:19:43,540 --> 00:19:44,100
General Lu,

337
00:19:45,220 --> 00:19:46,780
the Crown Prince and Princess of Huai

338
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:48,900
stand before you
with His Majesty's decree.

339
00:19:49,620 --> 00:19:50,420
Will you believe us,

340
00:19:51,300 --> 00:19:53,180
or these traitors who have no proof
at all?

341
00:19:59,100 --> 00:20:00,020
Princess Danyang,

342
00:20:00,420 --> 00:20:01,580
I'll claim the first victory!

343
00:20:11,060 --> 00:20:11,540
Catch!

344
00:20:22,260 --> 00:20:23,420
Qiu Shuo is dead.

345
00:20:27,020 --> 00:20:28,140
His Majesty's decree is before us.

346
00:20:28,780 --> 00:20:30,460
The Jinwu Guard shall obey
His Majesty's commands

347
00:20:30,740 --> 00:20:31,940
and fight these treacherous rebels!

348
00:20:32,340 --> 00:20:33,140
It is our duty!

349
00:20:36,020 --> 00:20:36,540
General Lu!

350
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:37,220
General Meng!

351
00:20:37,940 --> 00:20:39,540
We must strike against
that traitor Yu immediately!

352
00:20:40,460 --> 00:20:40,940
Charge!

353
00:20:56,580 --> 00:20:57,100
Sir.

354
00:20:58,180 --> 00:20:59,260
The Shence Army hasn't arrived.

355
00:21:00,540 --> 00:21:01,740
We can't stay here any longer.

356
00:21:51,020 --> 00:21:51,380
Lord Yu.

357
00:21:52,260 --> 00:21:52,660
Lord Yu.

358
00:21:53,940 --> 00:21:54,420
Just now,

359
00:21:54,980 --> 00:21:55,940
Prince of Jin's secondary consort
labored prematurely.

360
00:21:56,540 --> 00:21:57,100
and gave birth.

361
00:22:04,780 --> 00:22:06,220
This is Huai's new heir to the throne.

362
00:22:08,820 --> 00:22:09,140
Let's go.

363
00:22:11,340 --> 00:22:11,700
Godfather,

364
00:22:13,340 --> 00:22:14,220
what about that woman?

365
00:22:14,460 --> 00:22:15,100
What should we do with her?

366
00:22:20,940 --> 00:22:21,340
Lord Yu.

367
00:22:28,780 --> 00:22:29,580
A baby this young

368
00:22:30,340 --> 00:22:31,460
may not survive

369
00:22:31,940 --> 00:22:32,620
without its mother.

370
00:22:32,900 --> 00:22:33,300
Bring them both.

371
00:22:33,580 --> 00:22:33,860
Yes.

372
00:23:03,940 --> 00:23:04,380
You two,

373
00:23:05,460 --> 00:23:06,900
do you still have the daggers

374
00:23:07,180 --> 00:23:07,780
I gave you earlier?

375
00:23:11,060 --> 00:23:12,020
The man on the bed...

376
00:23:12,540 --> 00:23:13,780
I'll leave him to you.

377
00:23:20,140 --> 00:23:21,940
Didn't you hear what they said outside?

378
00:23:22,100 --> 00:23:23,580
That man is just a double,

379
00:23:23,660 --> 00:23:24,580
not the real emperor.

380
00:23:24,620 --> 00:23:25,220
What are you afraid of?

381
00:23:31,140 --> 00:23:31,900
Rest assured, Mr. Wei.

382
00:23:32,260 --> 00:23:32,700
I...

383
00:23:33,420 --> 00:23:34,420
am willing to see this through.

384
00:23:49,060 --> 00:23:49,820
You came back after all.

385
00:23:50,420 --> 00:23:51,180
If I hadn't,

386
00:23:51,700 --> 00:23:52,780
how would you have gotten out of that?

387
00:23:53,460 --> 00:23:54,700
I'm sorry about what happened earlier.

388
00:23:55,260 --> 00:23:56,900
I had to claim only a double
was at the temporary imperial palace.

389
00:23:57,340 --> 00:23:59,100
It was the only way to give Huai
and His Majesty a chance to survive.

390
00:23:59,340 --> 00:24:00,100
You're right.

391
00:24:07,820 --> 00:24:08,380
Father!

392
00:24:19,340 --> 00:24:19,860
Lord Yu,

393
00:24:20,620 --> 00:24:21,620
it's all taken care of.

394
00:24:23,140 --> 00:24:24,300
Wang Qing went weak
at the sight of blood

395
00:24:24,820 --> 00:24:25,740
and is still lying on the floor inside.

396
00:24:29,860 --> 00:24:30,220
Lord Yu,

397
00:24:30,780 --> 00:24:31,420
I'm a skilled rider.

398
00:24:31,740 --> 00:24:32,540
I can ride with one hand.

399
00:24:33,060 --> 00:24:34,060
Please let me carry the heir.

400
00:24:35,540 --> 00:24:35,900
All right.

401
00:24:43,620 --> 00:24:44,980
The Shence Army will meet us
to the east.

402
00:24:45,580 --> 00:24:46,900
Follow me. We'll join them there.

403
00:25:19,740 --> 00:25:20,140
Father!

404
00:25:30,620 --> 00:25:31,140
I'm fine.

405
00:25:31,140 --> 00:25:31,540
Father!

406
00:25:32,980 --> 00:25:33,420
Father!

407
00:25:34,780 --> 00:25:35,380
We're safe now.

408
00:25:36,820 --> 00:25:37,580
Thank goodness!

409
00:25:38,700 --> 00:25:39,300
Father.

410
00:25:41,820 --> 00:25:43,260
Yan Shang pays his respects
to Your Majesty.

411
00:25:56,180 --> 00:25:56,660
Father.

412
00:26:40,140 --> 00:26:40,500
Move aside!

413
00:26:51,500 --> 00:26:52,180
How dare you!

414
00:26:53,820 --> 00:26:54,620
Guards!

415
00:26:54,980 --> 00:26:55,460
Come on!

416
00:26:55,780 --> 00:26:57,580
Someone! Get in here!

417
00:26:58,980 --> 00:27:00,620
Help!

418
00:28:07,260 --> 00:28:07,980
I'll go get her!

419
00:28:11,060 --> 00:28:11,820
Go! Sir, hurry!

420
00:28:15,660 --> 00:28:16,060
Chunhua!

421
00:28:22,100 --> 00:28:22,420
Go!

422
00:28:43,340 --> 00:28:43,780
Chunhua!

423
00:28:44,940 --> 00:28:45,340
Chunhua!

424
00:28:46,860 --> 00:28:47,140
Come on!

425
00:28:47,420 --> 00:28:47,900
Wenji...

426
00:28:48,740 --> 00:28:49,660
I can't run anymore.

427
00:28:50,900 --> 00:28:51,540
Go without me.

428
00:28:51,540 --> 00:28:51,940
No.

429
00:28:55,260 --> 00:28:55,900
Search over there!

430
00:28:56,340 --> 00:28:56,780
- Hurry!
- Yes, sir!

431
00:28:59,380 --> 00:28:59,860
After them!

432
00:29:03,020 --> 00:29:03,940
Search every inch!

433
00:29:04,180 --> 00:29:04,820
Look carefully!

434
00:29:05,380 --> 00:29:06,260
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

435
00:29:44,260 --> 00:29:44,660
Chunhua.

436
00:29:45,780 --> 00:29:46,220
Chunhua.

437
00:29:47,300 --> 00:29:47,740
Chunhua.

438
00:29:52,540 --> 00:29:53,060
It's all right now.

439
00:29:54,300 --> 00:29:55,180
We're safe, Chunhua.

440
00:29:56,580 --> 00:29:57,380
We're still alive.

441
00:29:57,700 --> 00:29:58,900
And so is the baby.

442
00:30:36,580 --> 00:30:36,940
Zidu!

443
00:30:38,900 --> 00:30:39,460
Zidu, hurry!

444
00:30:40,060 --> 00:30:40,380
Get on the horse!

445
00:30:41,660 --> 00:30:41,980
Quick!

446
00:31:07,500 --> 00:31:08,140
This is

447
00:31:08,980 --> 00:31:10,500
as far as I can go with you.

448
00:31:36,580 --> 00:31:37,020
Wenji.

449
00:31:39,700 --> 00:31:40,700
What do we do now?

450
00:31:45,340 --> 00:31:45,660
Wait.

451
00:31:47,780 --> 00:31:48,300
Wait for what?

452
00:31:48,940 --> 00:31:49,700
For dawn.

453
00:31:51,940 --> 00:31:52,940
Until the losers are branded traitors.

454
00:32:03,980 --> 00:32:05,140
Why is the baby so wrinkly?

455
00:32:05,740 --> 00:32:06,580
Kind of ugly, actually.

456
00:32:13,220 --> 00:32:13,500
No.

457
00:32:15,980 --> 00:32:16,540
Adorable.

458
00:32:21,100 --> 00:32:21,460
Just like you.

459
00:32:30,780 --> 00:32:31,260
Wenji,

460
00:32:33,460 --> 00:32:34,420
I can't remember

461
00:32:35,700 --> 00:32:36,980
the last time

462
00:32:37,860 --> 00:32:38,700
I felt this happy.

463
00:32:54,580 --> 00:32:55,140
Tell me,

464
00:32:55,860 --> 00:32:56,660
when morning comes,

465
00:32:57,340 --> 00:32:57,900
where should we go?

466
00:32:59,460 --> 00:32:59,900
Where?

467
00:33:00,780 --> 00:33:02,020
I'd love to go back to Lingnan.

468
00:33:04,180 --> 00:33:06,340
To that little hillside
where we first met.

469
00:33:07,740 --> 00:33:08,660
Lingnan is so warm.

470
00:33:10,260 --> 00:33:10,940
And full of flowers.

471
00:33:12,660 --> 00:33:13,260
I love it there.

472
00:33:22,060 --> 00:33:22,420
All right.

473
00:33:24,860 --> 00:33:25,540
When we get there,

474
00:33:28,340 --> 00:33:29,300
I'll lead your horse for you again.

475
00:33:32,780 --> 00:33:34,540
Then let's settle down
in a little village.

476
00:33:35,460 --> 00:33:36,420
Somewhere no one knows me,

477
00:33:37,140 --> 00:33:38,180
and no one knows you.

478
00:33:40,340 --> 00:33:43,780
♪Why must this world know joy and pain?♪

479
00:33:44,660 --> 00:33:45,660
We'll find a place

480
00:33:46,780 --> 00:33:47,500
with mountains

481
00:33:49,140 --> 00:33:50,300
and streams.

482
00:33:50,300 --> 00:33:51,980
♪The moon wanes and waxes,
lovers part and reunite♪

483
00:33:51,980 --> 00:33:53,020
We'll raise a few chickens and ducks.

484
00:33:54,540 --> 00:33:55,260
And out front,

485
00:33:56,620 --> 00:33:58,900
we'll plant some
of your favorite flowers.

486
00:34:00,140 --> 00:34:01,100
But I don't know how to raise
chickens or ducks.

487
00:34:01,380 --> 00:34:02,180
Or grow flowers.

488
00:34:02,180 --> 00:34:04,660
♪Time lies sealed beneath clouds
heavy with rain♪

489
00:34:04,660 --> 00:34:04,980
That's okay.

490
00:34:06,020 --> 00:34:06,700
I'll take care of everything.

491
00:34:06,700 --> 00:34:09,380
♪As darkness engulfs the palace
and wildlands sway♪

492
00:34:09,420 --> 00:34:14,060
♪What can I do,
with no one to light the way?♪

493
00:34:15,260 --> 00:34:19,000
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave;
One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

494
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:22,820
♪Ask not why spring is so hard to leave;
One fleeting moment, forever captive♪

495
00:34:22,900 --> 00:34:25,300
♪Fate falls just short
of granting our plea♪

496
00:34:25,420 --> 00:34:27,700
♪Yet round we turn, to meet again♪

497
00:34:27,940 --> 00:34:31,580
♪The past dissolves like smoke♪

498
00:34:31,700 --> 00:34:35,500
♪Ask not why longing has no end;
I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

499
00:34:35,500 --> 00:34:39,380
♪Ask not why longing has no end;
I pray our years ahead bring peace♪

500
00:34:39,620 --> 00:34:41,780
♪May sorrow end,
though sleepless we lie apart♪

501
00:34:41,860 --> 00:34:43,860
♪Each quietly endures the passing years♪

502
00:34:43,940 --> 00:34:48,060
♪Though close at hand,
we're worlds apart♪

503
00:34:48,060 --> 00:34:48,940
Is it almost dawn?

504
00:34:58,780 --> 00:35:00,460
I wish the sun would never rise.

505
00:35:19,180 --> 00:35:19,860
Everyone, over here!

506
00:35:25,740 --> 00:35:26,420
Who are you people?

507
00:35:29,380 --> 00:35:29,740
Take them away!

508
00:35:30,180 --> 00:35:30,540
Yes, sir!

509
00:35:32,540 --> 00:35:33,060
Chunhua!

510
00:35:41,140 --> 00:35:42,020
What a night!

511
00:35:42,620 --> 00:35:43,700
I'm completely exhausted.

512
00:35:47,100 --> 00:35:48,220
General Meng, it seems you've

513
00:35:48,740 --> 00:35:50,260
joined forces with the Crown Prince.

514
00:35:51,900 --> 00:35:52,980
Take me as a warning.

515
00:35:53,660 --> 00:35:56,020
The Mus' rule is rotten to the core.

516
00:35:57,060 --> 00:35:58,980
If you devote your life
to serving the Mu family,

517
00:35:59,540 --> 00:36:01,700
they'll dispose of you
once you've served your purpose.

518
00:36:03,940 --> 00:36:04,500
So?

519
00:36:05,300 --> 00:36:06,660
What I'm saying is,

520
00:36:08,820 --> 00:36:09,540
the Meng family of North Jing

521
00:36:10,700 --> 00:36:12,180
has produced heroes for generations.

522
00:36:13,180 --> 00:36:14,460
Surely you don't intend

523
00:36:14,820 --> 00:36:16,420
to spend your whole life

524
00:36:16,420 --> 00:36:18,580
as a mere military governor
of the Central Circuit?

525
00:36:20,980 --> 00:36:22,100
The Meng family's

526
00:36:22,380 --> 00:36:24,060
cavalry is unstoppable.

527
00:36:24,900 --> 00:36:27,660
And I command Huai's Shence Army,

528
00:36:28,020 --> 00:36:29,660
all 100,000 of its soldiers.

529
00:36:30,020 --> 00:36:31,380
If we join forces,

530
00:36:32,100 --> 00:36:35,300
we could put a whole new dynasty
on the throne.

531
00:36:37,580 --> 00:36:38,220
Right.

532
00:36:40,940 --> 00:36:41,460
Lord Yu.

533
00:36:43,020 --> 00:36:44,740
But you're just stalling for time.

534
00:36:47,220 --> 00:36:48,220
What's with all the talk?

535
00:36:49,620 --> 00:36:49,940
Where's the deer?

536
00:36:50,380 --> 00:36:50,900
What deer?

537
00:36:51,180 --> 00:36:52,620
I came here to hunt the deer.

538
00:36:53,180 --> 00:36:54,260
Hunt the deer?

539
00:36:57,380 --> 00:37:00,660
Who would actually come here
just to hunt a deer?

540
00:37:04,620 --> 00:37:06,780
You sent this scout to call
for reinforcements, didn't you?

541
00:37:07,660 --> 00:37:08,900
He's quite the fast runner.

542
00:37:10,540 --> 00:37:11,340
Just one step away.

543
00:37:11,860 --> 00:37:14,660
He almost made it
into the Shence Army's camp.

544
00:37:19,100 --> 00:37:19,420
Good.

545
00:37:20,900 --> 00:37:21,540
Very good.

546
00:37:24,460 --> 00:37:25,420
You care nothing for the throne,

547
00:37:26,060 --> 00:37:27,220
only for the woman you love.

548
00:37:28,660 --> 00:37:28,940
Good.

549
00:37:29,900 --> 00:37:30,300
Very good.

550
00:37:35,620 --> 00:37:36,540
To lose

551
00:37:37,820 --> 00:37:40,420
to a man as sincere and devoted as you,

552
00:37:41,540 --> 00:37:41,980
I have no regrets.

553
00:37:47,540 --> 00:37:48,900
If you'd just let me catch
that deer sooner,

554
00:37:50,980 --> 00:37:52,020
none of this would've happened.

555
00:38:05,300 --> 00:38:12,200
(Yuhua Palace, Yu)

556
00:38:42,700 --> 00:38:49,660
(Yu)

557
00:38:54,820 --> 00:38:55,140
General!

558
00:38:55,380 --> 00:38:56,620
We've searched the entire
temporary imperial palace.

559
00:38:56,780 --> 00:38:58,060
None of Yu's remaining
followers survived.

560
00:38:58,540 --> 00:38:59,100
Withdraw the troops.

561
00:39:00,420 --> 00:39:01,860
But Princess Danyang is still inside.

562
00:39:20,300 --> 00:39:26,460
♪A daughter ventures forth,
in the name her father gave♪

563
00:39:26,820 --> 00:39:32,980
♪Into savage lands,
to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

564
00:39:34,460 --> 00:39:40,620
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

565
00:39:41,140 --> 00:39:44,860
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

566
00:39:44,860 --> 00:39:48,340
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

567
00:39:48,980 --> 00:39:52,520
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

568
00:39:52,520 --> 00:39:56,060
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

569
00:39:56,180 --> 00:39:59,600
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

570
00:39:59,600 --> 00:40:03,340
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

571
00:40:04,420 --> 00:40:05,140
You're free.

572
00:40:05,140 --> 00:40:07,780
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

573
00:40:07,860 --> 00:40:10,380
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪

574
00:40:10,540 --> 00:40:14,060
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

575
00:40:14,380 --> 00:40:17,900
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

576
00:40:17,940 --> 00:40:22,180
♪With sacrificed innocence
and a soul snowbound♪

577
00:40:22,660 --> 00:40:23,460
You're free.

578
00:40:23,460 --> 00:40:24,900
♪If the road is blocked,
I'll fight my way through♪

579
00:40:24,900 --> 00:40:28,020
♪Cut down the crowd,
strike down the proud gods♪

580
00:40:28,140 --> 00:40:31,260
♪Break through Hell's gates♪

581
00:40:31,940 --> 00:40:36,020
♪If I could meet my former self again♪

582
00:40:36,500 --> 00:40:39,300
♪Don't be afraid,
I'll become a demon for you♪

583
00:40:39,340 --> 00:40:45,580
♪Through fire, I'll turn the
dark towers bright as day for you♪

584
00:40:46,220 --> 00:40:50,020
♪Though this world is hard to cross,
I'll lead you through♪

585
00:40:50,220 --> 00:40:53,180
♪I dare face the unknown,
with my sword in hand♪

586
00:40:53,500 --> 00:40:57,160
♪I'll guard my princess,
and keep her tears at bay♪

587
00:40:57,340 --> 00:41:01,420
♪A tooth for a tooth;
A scar for a scar♪

588
00:41:01,420 --> 00:41:05,700
♪A tooth for a tooth;
A scar for a scar♪

589
00:41:06,460 --> 00:41:09,860
♪One song of slaughter follows another♪

590
00:41:11,140 --> 00:41:15,240
♪Mourn the blooms of youth;
Mourn my bridal hair♪

591
00:41:15,240 --> 00:41:19,660
♪Mourn the blooms of youth;
Mourn my bridal hair♪

592
00:41:20,260 --> 00:41:23,900
♪Not another tear shall fall♪

593
00:41:23,900 --> 00:41:24,740
Hurry! Take everything away!

594
00:41:29,460 --> 00:41:29,940
I'll take that.

595
00:41:44,860 --> 00:41:46,660
Princess Danyang has arrived!

596
00:41:57,860 --> 00:41:58,340
Chunhua!

597
00:42:05,620 --> 00:42:06,140
Your Highness.

598
00:42:08,180 --> 00:42:08,780
Are you all right?

599
00:42:11,060 --> 00:42:11,620
I'm fine.

600
00:42:23,140 --> 00:42:23,620
Wenji.

601
00:42:47,660 --> 00:42:48,220
You may leave.

602
00:43:02,100 --> 00:43:06,820
(Huai)

603
00:43:06,820 --> 00:43:07,140
Shang.

604
00:43:10,340 --> 00:43:11,300
You're the one who saved His Majesty?

605
00:43:12,060 --> 00:43:13,220
(Huai)
Liu Wenji, you've really...

606
00:43:14,460 --> 00:43:15,540
got some nerve.

607
00:43:16,540 --> 00:43:18,580
How dare you pull that off
right under Yu Cheng'an's nose?

608
00:43:24,340 --> 00:43:24,940
Actually,

609
00:43:26,540 --> 00:43:27,580
I had a lot on my mind at the time.

610
00:43:30,260 --> 00:43:31,260
But then I thought,

611
00:43:32,740 --> 00:43:34,220
I couldn't let Yu Cheng'an
win like that.

612
00:43:35,420 --> 00:43:36,100
Whether it's Chunhua

613
00:43:36,660 --> 00:43:37,260
or her child,

614
00:43:37,980 --> 00:43:38,780
in his eyes,

615
00:43:40,260 --> 00:43:41,900
they're nothing but tools he can destroy

616
00:43:42,380 --> 00:43:43,220
or throw away at any moment.

617
00:43:45,660 --> 00:43:49,180
(Huai)

618
00:43:49,180 --> 00:43:50,060
I wanted to give Chunhua and her baby

619
00:43:50,940 --> 00:43:51,500
a chance to live.

620
00:43:56,100 --> 00:43:56,660
Wenji,

621
00:43:57,700 --> 00:43:58,380
that's just like you!

622
00:44:05,900 --> 00:44:06,340
Your Highness,

623
00:44:07,620 --> 00:44:08,340
where's Yu Cheng'an?

624
00:44:10,460 --> 00:44:11,020
He lost.

625
00:44:15,980 --> 00:44:20,740
(Next Episode Preview)

626
00:44:21,340 --> 00:44:21,740
Your Highness.

627
00:44:22,860 --> 00:44:23,340
What is it?

628
00:44:27,100 --> 00:44:27,580
Yan Shang,

629
00:44:28,580 --> 00:44:29,620
no matter when,

630
00:44:30,460 --> 00:44:31,900
no matter what happens,

631
00:44:33,380 --> 00:44:34,780
I'll protect you.

632
00:44:37,880 --> 00:44:41,173
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

633
00:44:43,858 --> 00:44:48,774
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

634
00:44:50,968 --> 00:44:56,813
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

635
00:44:57,313 --> 00:45:02,539
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

636
00:45:05,308 --> 00:45:10,099
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

637
00:45:10,935 --> 00:45:17,014
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

638
00:45:18,815 --> 00:45:21,965
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

639
00:45:21,965 --> 00:45:23,613
♪Burning bright as a song♪

640
00:45:23,665 --> 00:45:27,389
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

641
00:45:27,767 --> 00:45:32,433
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

642
00:45:33,052 --> 00:45:37,093
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

643
00:45:37,584 --> 00:45:39,699
♪Not a single hour less♪

644
00:45:39,739 --> 00:45:46,685
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

645
00:45:47,448 --> 00:45:50,901
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

646
00:45:51,081 --> 00:45:54,226
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

647
00:45:54,665 --> 00:46:01,302
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

648
00:46:01,699 --> 00:46:03,737
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

649
00:46:03,737 --> 00:46:06,213
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

650
00:46:06,251 --> 00:46:08,720
♪You're the only one I need♪

651
00:46:08,924 --> 00:46:15,811
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

652
00:46:16,123 --> 00:46:19,394
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

653
00:46:19,699 --> 00:46:22,872
♪My last untouched innocence♪

654
00:46:23,196 --> 00:46:26,622
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

655
00:46:26,855 --> 00:46:30,080
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

656
00:46:30,411 --> 00:46:37,207
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

657
00:46:37,576 --> 00:46:39,638
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

658
00:46:39,639 --> 00:46:42,142
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

659
00:46:42,189 --> 00:46:44,527
♪You're the only one I need♪

660
00:46:44,758 --> 00:46:51,593
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

661
00:46:51,942 --> 00:46:53,560
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

662
00:46:53,690 --> 00:46:55,486
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

663
00:46:55,843 --> 00:46:58,860
♪You're the only one I need♪

664
00:46:58,900 --> 00:47:00,227
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

